    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">This article is about a mob that spawns in the so called fairy room of dungeons. For other uses, see <a href=\"/w/Fairy_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Fairy (disambiguation)\">Fairy (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Fairy</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Fairy.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Fairy.png\"><img alt=\"Fairy.png\" src=\"/images/Fairy.png?ccc85\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"475\" height=\"512\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"475\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<a href=\"/w/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\">Mob</a></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Spawn Location</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<ul style=\"line-height:inherit;margin-top:0;list-style-type:none;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\"><li style=\"margin-left: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-bottom: 0;\"><a href=\"/w/The_Catacombs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Catacombs\">The Catacombs</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Mob Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div class=\"plainlist\">None\n</div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Stats</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><a href=\"/w/Health\" title=\"Health\"><span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xe010;&#160;</span>Health</span></a></span>: 4</div></div><div class=\"group\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Drops</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Drops</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<ul style=\"line-height:inherit;margin-top:0;list-style-type:none;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\"><li style=\"margin-left: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-bottom: 0;\"><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Revive_Stone\" title=\"Revive Stone\"><img alt=\"Revive Stone\" src=\"/images/thumb/Revive_Stone.png/21px-Revive_Stone.png?8681c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Revive_Stone.png/42px-Revive_Stone.png?8681c 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1x</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Revive_Stone\" title=\"Revive Stone\">Revive Stone</a></li><li style=\"margin-left: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-bottom: 0;\"><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings\" title=\"Fairy Wings\"><img alt=\"Fairy Wings\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/21px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/42px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">0–1x</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings\" title=\"Fairy Wings\">Fairy Wings</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Fairies</b> are <a href=\"/w/Dungeons\" title=\"Dungeons\">Dungeons</a> mobs that spawn around <a href=\"/w/Fairy_Trees\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fairy Trees\">Fairy Trees</a>, which will appear in pink rooms on the Dungeon Map. Fairies will drop a <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Revive_Stone\" title=\"Revive Stone\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Revive_Stone.png/21px-Revive_Stone.png?8681c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Revive_Stone.png/42px-Revive_Stone.png?8681c 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Revive_Stone\" title=\"Revive Stone\">Revive Stone</a>, which can revive a dead player. \n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Dialogue\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Dialogue\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">After teammate killed Fairy\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\">&lt;name&gt; the Fairy</span><span class=\"format-f\">: Have a great life!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Killing Fairy\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\">&lt;name&gt; the Fairy</span><span class=\"format-f\">: You killed me! Take this </span><span class=\"format-6\">Revive Stone</span><span class=\"format-f\"> so my death is not in vain!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Killing Fairy whilst a Ghost\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\">&lt;name&gt; the Fairy</span><span class=\"format-f\">: You killed me! I will revive you so my death is not in vain!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Hitting with <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Shears\" title=\"Shears\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Shears.png/21px-Shears.png?f9824\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Shears.png/42px-Shears.png?f9824 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Shears\" title=\"Shears\">Shears</a>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\">&lt;name&gt; the Fairy</span><span class=\"format-f\">: I like your spirit, but those are not mysterious enough!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Hitting with <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Shears\" title=\"Enchanted Shears\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Shears.png/21px-Enchanted_Shears.png?1095b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Shears.png/42px-Enchanted_Shears.png?1095b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Shears\" title=\"Enchanted Shears\">Enchanted Shears</a>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\">&lt;name&gt; the Fairy</span><span class=\"format-f\">: You clipped my wings! Take this </span><span class=\"format-5\">Fairy Wings</span><span class=\"format-f\"> so my loss is not in vain!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Fairies can have different names, including Akia, Tyene, Yve, Ilene or Steve.</li>\n<li>When <a href=\"/w/The_Catacombs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Catacombs\">The Catacombs</a> first released, the mechanics behind the Special Score calculation were unclear. This led to a popular misconception that killing <b>Fairies</b> reduced it, but this has since been proven to be false.</li>\n<li>Two Fairies will spawn in the stands during the <a href=\"/w/Thorn\" title=\"Thorn\">Thorn</a>  boss fight.</li>\n<li>Contrary to what <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Tia_the_Fairy\" title=\"Tia the Fairy\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Tia the Fairy in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tia_the_Fairy_Sprite.png/16px-Tia_the_Fairy_Sprite.png?1b767\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tia_the_Fairy_Sprite.png/32px-Tia_the_Fairy_Sprite.png?1b767 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Tia_the_Fairy\" title=\"Tia the Fairy\">Tia the Fairy</a> and the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Fairylosopher\" title=\"Fairylosopher\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Fairylosopher in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fairylosopher_Sprite.png/16px-Fairylosopher_Sprite.png?3f03f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fairylosopher_Sprite.png/32px-Fairylosopher_Sprite.png?3f03f 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Fairylosopher\" title=\"Fairylosopher\">Fairylosophers</a> say, they don't spawn a fairy soul upon death.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2020/July_7\" title=\"Changelog/2020/July 7\">Jul&#160;7,&#160;2020</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.8</th><td>Added Fairies</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">Oct&#160;5,&#160;2022</th><td>Hitting a <b>Fairy</b> with <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Shears\" title=\"Enchanted Shears\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Shears.png/21px-Enchanted_Shears.png?1095b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Shears.png/42px-Enchanted_Shears.png?1095b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Shears\" title=\"Enchanted Shears\">Enchanted Shears</a> now drops <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings\" title=\"Fairy Wings\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/21px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/42px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings\" title=\"Fairy Wings\">Fairy Wings</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2023/September_26\" title=\"Changelog/2023/September 26\">Sep&#160;26,&#160;2023</a></th><td>Mage Beam can now deal damage to Fairies.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐w42tb\nCached time: 20261023050548\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.446 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.808 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 302/1000000\nRevision size: 2027/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 13788/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1347/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/50\nBucket time usage: 0.014/10 seconds\nLua time usage: 0.290/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 10362843/367001600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  589.144      1 -total\n 72.92%  429.596      1 Template:Infobox/Dungeon_enemy\n 12.84%   75.617      1 Template:Resource_List\n  9.14%   53.847      1 Template:About\n  7.76%   45.738      1 Template:History_table\n  6.06%   35.692      3 Template:History\n  4.58%   26.971      5 Template:Item\n  4.06%   23.936      2 Template:NPCSprite\n  3.72%   21.927      1 Template:InfoboxMobStats\n  2.40%   14.115      1 Template:Zone_List\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_hypixelskyblockwiki:pcache:68877:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261023050548 and revision id 858561. Rendering was triggered because: edit-page\n -->\n</div>",
